{"id":"rzt5a7b01zn8bujqdcbzx00d2","title":"学者的团队建设","originalTitle":null,"summary":"学术团队应围绕稳定科学主线，构建互补梯队，注重公平机制与求真传承文化。带头人应聚焦顶层思考，青年骨干各展所长，硕博研究生是创新主力。成果分配透明公正，鼓励自由探索与内部批评，支持青年学者独立发展。团队规模不宜过大，避免唯论文指标论，关注成员身心状态。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=575926&do=blog&id=1560217"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-08T01:50:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-08T06:52:19.961Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-08T06:52:19.961Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":31,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"7d5b27b8-006f-475c-b24e-79fa4925bf4a","title":"学者提出团队建设四大核心要素"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"7d5b27b8-006f-475c-b24e-79fa4925bf4a","title":"学者提出团队建设四大核心要素"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fLzOxVmiExBA","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}